                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Set up an **Umbral Spellportal** wholly within 18&quot; of the caster and visible to them. 
An **Umbral Spellportal** has 2 parts that must be set up within 9&quot; of each other.</characteristic>
