                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Set up a **Ravening Direflock** wholly within 18&quot; of the caster and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units. A **Ravening Direflock** has 3 parts that must each be set up within 1&quot; of at least 1 other part.</characteristic>
