                <characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">5</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Drothkeepers Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Drothkeepers Magmadroth^^** wholly within 12&quot; of them to be a target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Until the start of your next turn, the Damage characteristic of the target&apos;s **Roaring Fyrestream** is 3 instead of D3.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic>
