                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Sylvaneth Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn:
• The target cannot use **^^Run^^** abilities.
• Subtract 1 from charge rolls for the target.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic>
