                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Pick 1 of the following effects:
• **Heal (D3)** the target.
• Subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks that target that friendly unit until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
