                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Seraphon Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of the target&apos;s weapons until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
