                <characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">If there is not a friendly **Runic Fyrewall** on the battlefield, pick a friendly **Fyreslayers Priest** to chant this prayer, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Set up a **Runic Fyrewall** wholly within 12&quot; of the chanter and visible to them.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**, **^^Summon^^**</characteristic>
