                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Kruleboyz Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Kruleboyz^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, add 1 to save rolls for attacks that target that friendly unit</characteristic>
