                <characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Ironjawz Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Ironjawz^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">**Heal (D6)** the target. If the chanting roll was 8+, **Heal (D3+3)** the target instead.</characteristic>
