                <characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">If there is not a friendly **Sanctum of Amyntok** on the battlefield, pick a friendly **^^Lumineth Realm‑lords Wizard^^** to cast this spell, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Set up a **Sanctum of Amyntok** within 12&quot; of the caster and more than 3&quot; from all enemy units. A **Sanctum of Amyntok** has 3 parts that must be set up touching each other so that they form a ring.</characteristic>
