                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Droggz&apos;s Gitmob^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
