                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Skaven Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn</characteristic>
