                <characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">8</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Gnawhorde Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Gnawhorde Infantry^^** unit wholly within 13&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6. The casting roll for this spell cannot be modified.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn:
•  The target has **^^Strike-first^^**.
•  The target cannot use commands.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic>
