                <characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Astral Templars Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Astral Templars^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Add 1 to wound rolls for the target&apos;s combat attacks for the rest of the turn. If the chanting roll was 6+, you can pick up to 2 eligible units to be the targets instead of 1.</characteristic>
