                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">If there is not a friendly **Hand of Nagash** on the battlefield, pick a friendly **^^Soulblight Gravelords Wizard^^** to cast this spell, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Set up a **Hand of Nagash** wholly within 12&quot; of and visible to the caster and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic>
