                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Fyreslayers Monster^^** wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Until the start of your next turn, if any damage points were inflicted on an enemy unit by the target&apos;s &apos;Volcanic Blood&apos; ability, after the damage sequence has been resolved, inflict 3 mortal damage on that target. If the chanting roll was 6+, inflict D3+3 mortal damage instead.</characteristic>
