                <characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">5</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them and that was not set up this turn to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">The target can use the &apos;Normal Move&apos; ability as if it were your movement phase. If the chanting roll was 10+, you can pick another eligible unit to be a second target.</characteristic>
