              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">3</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Daughters of Khaine Aelf Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them and that has not been picked to be the target of this prayer this turn to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">The target can move up to 6&quot;. It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units but cannot end that move in combat. If the chanting roll was 8+, you can pick another eligible unit to be a second target.</characteristic>
